# Renders docs/media/itops-demo.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/itops-demo.tape
Output docs/media/itops-demo.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1050
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# OpenAgentOS: the failure-recovery ladder — fallback, rollback, escalate"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m apps.itops.demo 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 20s
